# The pictures of history.md: a bolt's groups, one moved up the list,
# one suppressed with what uses it; then the history example, whose last
# step deletes the block's sketch and lists what went with it.
load thread/bolt_m8x30.tlspr
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
cursor off
shot history-1-groups
cursor off
twmove 307 180
mark 292 169 32 24 tw
shot history-2-arrow tw
twdown L 307 180
twup L 307 180
cursor off
shot history-3-moved tw
twmove 145 160
twdown L 145 160
twup L 145 160
cursor on
twmove 20 165
mark 10 162 452 22 tw
shot history-4-suppress-box tw
twdown L 20 165
twup L 20 165
cursor off
shot history-5-suppressed gw
twmove 28 10
twdown L 28 10
twup L 28 10
shot history-6-left-out tw
answer no
menu File|New
file $repo/examples/scripts/history/history.go
menu Script|Run File...
cursor on
twmove 190 238
mark 18 230 200 22 tw
shot history-7-broken-link tw
twdown L 190 238
twup L 190 238
cursor off
shot history-8-broken tw
